@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = {{accessToken}}

### Income/expense summary + per-category breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/summary?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Trend, unit=day/week/month
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/trend?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30&unit=day
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Account balances
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/statistics/account-balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
